# 本机 core.autocrlf=true。node / pwsh 脚本虽不依赖 sed/awk 抽文本，
# 但 CRLF 往返会让 diff 出现纯行尾噪声，掩盖真实改动。统一按LF 入库、
# 检出时由 Git 转换，Windows 侧的 node 与 PowerShell 5.1 都能正常读取。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary
*.zip binary
